{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09412","headline":"饵黄精 · 韦应物","name":"饵黄精","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵药出西山，服食采其根。\n九蒸换凡骨，经着上世言。\n候火起中夜，馨香满南轩。\n斋居感衆灵，药术啓妙门。\n自怀物外心，岂与俗士论。\n终期脱印绶，永与天壤存。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}